{"author":{"id":"dec876858d28babbadcead4137861bf586626b8518cbce9c5f4fc52ac3b424b8"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1795683545,"nonce":"mMO2ppl1OSjRoIai2ZsSTJY49t8=","title":"Component book pages describe API that the code does not have","message":"Found while rewriting the pages behind the web components in plain English. The meaning of every claim was left as it was. These come from reading the source, not from compiling the examples. Checked a second time: `card_title`, `.pop_out`, the `MarkdownConfig` heading fields, `TextSpan` having no `Default`, and the `stroke_rect` signature.\n\ncn/card.md\n- Most examples use `card_title()` and `card_description()`; card.rs has `card`, `card_header` (`.title`, `.description`), `card_content`, `card_footer`.\n- `checkbox().checked(true).child(..)`: `checkbox` takes a `Signal\u003cbool\u003e`; no `.checked` or `.child`.\n- `input()` with no argument and `.input_type(\"password\")`: `input` takes the shared state, `input_type` takes `InputType`.\n- `ButtonBuilder` has no `full_width`; no `grid_cols` method found.\n- \"All div styling props\": `Card` forwards only `child, w, h, w_full, max_w, p, px, py, m, shadow_lg, shadow_md, bg, class, id`.\n- Background `theme.colors.card` and radius `theme.radius.lg`: the sheet uses `--surface` / `--cn-card-bg` and `--radius-xl` / `--cn-card-radius`.\n\ncn/form.md\n- Credits `.cn-checkbox` and `.cn-radio` rules with hover, disabled and mark transitions that are `.blinc-checkbox` / `.blinc-radio*` rules in the layout UA sheet.\n- Omits that `Integer` and `Url` inputs and required or minimum-length checks also set invalid.\n\ncn/button.md: no row for `.cn-button--custom`.\ncn/dialog.md: reads as if all three panels take `.class(..)`; `SheetBuilder` has none.\ncn/data-display.md: not every chart takes `.band` and `.marker` (pie and comparison have neither; histogram's marker takes an `f64`).\ncn/layout.md: `.cn-chevron` carries no `data-state`.\ncn/navigation.md: `.min_width` sets the menu width, not its place.\ncn/pickers.md: partial time text does commit a single in-range digit; `size` only sets `data-size`.\n\nwidgets/markdown.md\n- Light and dark claims: `default()` and `light()` take the global theme's colours and differ in sizes.\n- Syntax highlighting claimed; the renderer drops the language and never calls `.syntax()`.\n- `heading_color`, `heading_margin_top`, `heading_margin_bottom` are not `MarkdownConfig` fields.\nwidgets/markdown.md and text.md: `--features windowed` is not a feature of blinc_app_examples.\n\nwidgets/canvas.md: `stroke_rect` and `stroke_circle` take `\u0026Stroke`, not a width; `push_clip` takes a `ClipShape`.\n\nwidgets/text.md: vertical align is Top, Center, Baseline; no `.wrap(bool)`; link open works on desktop only; the `TextSpan` example does not compile; two ranges are off by one.\n\nanimation/motion.md: `.pop_out` does not exist; exit must be triggered explicitly; each `*_in` call replaces the earlier enter animation, so they do not combine; the `AnimationPreset` import fails; the `card_list` example hides nothing; the state example defines `Page` and does not use it.\n\nwidgets/media.md\n- URL images need the `blinc_image` `network` feature, which neither facade enables.\n- Only PNG and JPEG are default; GIF, WebP, BMP are opt-in; no ICO decoder.\n- Lazy loading starts 100 px before view; the default placeholder is a translucent grey.\n- `svg(\"path.svg\")` parses the string as markup; no `Svg::h_auto`, no `Image::rounded_full` (`circular`).\n- `StatefulBuilder` has no `w/h/rounded/flex_center` before `on_state`; `.child(iterator)` does not exist; a match returns two types.\n- Images default to 100x100, so width and height are not required.\n\nwidgets/virtual-list.md: the window follows the scroll offset (visible rows plus overscan), with spacers above and below; `gap_px` goes to the outer container, so rows get no gap.\nwidgets/notch.md: no canvas fill now; the shape goes through render props.\nwidgets/audio-video.md: the video sample has sound; commit b5cb051a restored it.","files":null}]}